{{Quote|text=Would you look at that? It's the new farmer everyone has been talkin' about. Finally moved to the valley, I see. I've been workin' Fairhaven Farm here for many years. It ain't much, but it's honest work. You're lucky you got that free property from your grandpa.}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a befriendable NPC who works as a farmer on a small plot of land in [[Stardew:Cindersap Forest|Cindersap Forest]].

{{TOC|limit=2}}

==Schedule==
<p>Andy is awake every morning before 6am. In the event JojaMart closes, Andy will go to Pierre's General Store instead. If the Farmer purchases Aurora Vineyard, Andy will remain on Fairhaven Farm instead.</p>
<p>After the Beach Resort on Ginger Island is unlocked, Andy may randomly spend the day there. After leaving the Island at 6pm, Andy will immediately go home to bed.</p>
